# VS Code REST Client / HTTP file for manual testing the backend API
# Usage: Install the "REST Client" extension (humao.rest-client) and click "Send Request" above each request.

@baseUrl = http://136.244.109.212:8000
# Override host if deployed:

### Basic listings query
GET {{baseUrl}}/listings?city=Amsterdam&max_price=1500&min_size=20&limit=20
Accept: application/json

### With explicit min_price
GET {{baseUrl}}/listings?city=Amsterdam&min_price=800&max_price=1500&min_size=20&limit=20
Accept: application/json

### With keyword query `q` (optional, backend may ignore empty string)
GET {{baseUrl}}/listings?city=Amsterdam&max_price=1500&min_size=20&q=&limit=20
Accept: application/json

### Sort by area (descending)
GET {{baseUrl}}/listings?city=Amsterdam&max_price=1500&min_size=20&order_by=area_m2&order_dir=desc&limit=20
Accept: application/json

### Health or root (optional, depends on backend implementation)
# GET {{baseUrl}}/health
# Accept: application/json
